# A terminal demo of `trips`, the Weekend Trips CLI, which does not exist yet: fake-trips prints its
# planned output. Recorded at 80x24 by server/studio/terminal.ts, inside the sandbox.
Output trips.gif
Output trips.webm
Output trips.txt

Require bash
Set Shell bash
Set Columns 80
Set Rows 24
Set FontSize 16
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "alias trips='bash ./fake-trips' && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "trips plan"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "trips pick 1"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
